Hi Janet,

Attached are the issued annual renewal terms, HBC-JDH-20260717-REN-01 v1.0, a=
nd the accompanying support scope, HBC-JDH-20260716-SVC-01 v1.0. Donald has a=
pproved the issue copy on Halstead's behalf.

The annual term runs from August 1, 2026 through July 31, 2027. It provides a=
 contract limit of 520 seats and 60 hours of support for USD 248,000 for the =
year. The 60 hours are a shared balance for the uses described in the scope; =
Darren will share the record of time performed and the remaining balance with=
 you monthly.

The existing 480 seats continue from August 1. The additional 40 will be allo=
cated in two stages after Divya's readiness confirmation and JDH's roster, si=
te contacts, day and night practice, resolution of issues, and approval of th=
e releases. The term starts August 1; the allocation dates and group sizes re=
main to be determined.

Please return your purchasing confirmation by 4:00 p.m. MDT today, July 17, i=
dentifying the terms as HBC-JDH-20260717-REN-01 v1.0 and the support scope as=
 HBC-JDH-20260716-SVC-01 v1.0. Your written acceptance of the issued terms wi=
ll complete the agreement. If you need more time, please let me know before t=
he deadline so I can check the price authorization again.

Thank you,
